{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations - you\u2019ve been hired at Hellmart!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Northern State.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you\u2019ll work your first three full shifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird customers. Strange things are happening in the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And something in the dark that really wants to meet you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just make it through three days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DAYTIME \u2014 ALMOST A NORMAL STORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hit your daily sales quota</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Restock shelves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Keep the store and surrounding area clean</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Work the register</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- DON\u2019T BE RUDE TO CUSTOMERS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036410/extras/0f6a0430e9962589bbf162644126ac69.poster.avif?t=1760346993\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036410/extras/0f6a0430e9962589bbf162644126ac69.webm?t=1760346993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IN THE EVENING \u2014 evil awakens. Get ready for its visit:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Watch the generator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Barricade the doors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Check the security cams</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Buy supplies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Upgrade the store to survive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- DON'T LET EVIL GET IN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsi